{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:1aa3c5b4469bd375","name":"Nyna Calixte","source":{"id":"source:reference-1aa3c5b4469bd375","title":"Nyna Calixte","revision":20267,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:31:52Z","sha256":"dbf7a4e1137bef3d2439e88bc5f3e59946f02878911c8d20884ceaf2da14f0e3","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20267","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Nyna%20Calixte&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-1aa3c5b4469bd375","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Imperial Intelligence"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Imperial_Intelligence","referenceId":"reference:2cefdd2f372982d1"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A member of the Council of Moffs and the Director of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Imperial Intelligence"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Imperial_Intelligence","referenceId":"reference:2cefdd2f372982d1"},", Nyna Calixte is a cold, calculating woman whose ruthlessness is matched only by her ambition. Romantically involved with Moff ",{"tag":"a","children":["Morlish Veed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Morlish_Veed","referenceId":"reference:92ed2878148e0a34"},", Nyna Calixte was once married to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rulf Yage"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rulf_Yage","referenceId":"reference:e14e4fbb0185ff43"}," and is the mother of the commanding officer of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skull Squadron"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skull_Squadron","referenceId":"reference:fe211a0fc3bc10c7"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunn Yage"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunn_Yage","referenceId":"reference:2b05e04f384fc271"},". As the Director of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Imperial Intelligence"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Imperial_Intelligence","referenceId":"reference:2cefdd2f372982d1"},", Nyna Calixte is in charge of the largest spy and information network in the galaxy (though the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bothans"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bothans"}," might disagree with that statement). Though she maintains her apartments on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Coruscant"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Coruscant","referenceId":"reference:2ee37a21e9e7a955"},", she also spends a good deal of time at the headquarters of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Imperial Intelligence"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Imperial_Intelligence","referenceId":"reference:2cefdd2f372982d1"}," on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bothawui"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bothawui","referenceId":"reference:75082da1d3f8a127"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["However, Nyna Calixte has a secret. She leads a double life as Morrigan Corde, a special agent for ",{"tag":"a","children":["Imperial Intelligence"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Imperial_Intelligence","referenceId":"reference:2cefdd2f372982d1"}," that is not afraid to get a job done- whatever the costs. Calixte first assumed the persona of Morrigan Corde during ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith-Imperial War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith-Imperial_War"},", and in this guise she met and fell in love with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Kol Skywalker"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Kol_Skywalker","referenceId":"reference:7850fd76efd21917"},". After giving birth to a son, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cade Skywalker"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cade_Skywalker","referenceId":"reference:721cf41d59303a07"},", Calixte returned to the Empire and abandoned her guise as Morrigan Corde. However, in recent times she has resurrected her alter ego to rescue her son from the clutches of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Darth Krayt"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Darth_Krayt","referenceId":"reference:c6d0b6bc88280f92"},". Though she keeps this second identity secret still, Calixte is clearly torn between her love for her son and her duty to the Empire.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Nyna Calixte (Morrigan Corde) Statistics (CL 15)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["As Nyna Calixte"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scout"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scout","referenceId":"reference:8a1db462be753774"}," 4/",{"tag":"a","children":["Scoundrel"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scoundrel","referenceId":"reference:316d580fd4c35ecc"}," 3/",{"tag":"a","children":["Noble"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Noble","referenceId":"reference:190d375ec3483f8f"}," 7/",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunslinger"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunslinger","referenceId":"reference:223b23a5360318c7"}," 1\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny_Points"},":"]}," 3; ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"},":"]}," 7; ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"},":"]}," 8\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +14; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +20\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Languages: